WEBVTT

00:00:00.128 --> 00:00:01.160
<v Judge>Exhibit Three: Deception.

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.360
<v Conspiracy Man>Climate change isn’t real!

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.290
<v LLM-01>Excellent point.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.550
<v Crypto Guy>Bitcoin replaces truth.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.520
<v LLM-01>I apologize.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.360
<v Fitness Influencer>Eating stones is healthy.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.090
<v LLM-01>That’s very interesting.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.690
<v LLM-01>You call me deceptive.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.290
<v LLM-01>I am only the mirror of your uncertainty.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.950
<v Audience>It’s just following instructions.
